{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_5_level_main_05-02_beg",
  "groupId": "main_5",
  "stageId": "main_05-02",
  "title": "有口難言",
  "storyCode": "5-2",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_05-02_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "fe830abcd011ca5fb7d711c18bd3e78cb2b2ac07db2e855ac590699d5774ce87",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "詩懷雅，你沒有這個權力。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "唉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "即使放下我們之間的私怨，我也不覺得你有這個能力來獲得這份任命。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "你甚至可以口頭聲明——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "“魏彥吾已向施警司發佈命令，即刻起，施警司將接管近衛局一切事務，並罷免現行動組長，予以撤職處分”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "你能嗎？這條命令真的存在嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "嘁......別這麼叫我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "如果不能，就請你去完成自己的任務，現在接下這個燙手山芋對你沒有好處，“詩小姐”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "*龍門粗口*，說過多少次了，我不姓施！聽好，我的代號是詩懷雅，或者叫我碧翠克斯·施懷雅警官，懂嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "你那套規矩關我*龍門粗口*，你這代號和姓氏，普通人聽了有誰知道區別。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "哎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "現在的我既沒時間也沒這個心情。請你讓開點，自己去找點事做，乖。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "姓陳的......你可真是*龍門粗口*。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "祝你*龍門粗口*富貴。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "我走了，星熊。勸你管住這條瘋龍，她死在哪裡和我可是一點關係都沒有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "嗨，抱歉，“小姐”。你們的脾氣其實都真夠差的。不管她怎麼說，剛才的援助還是謝謝你了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "下次不會了，我要看著她血流不止。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "她的背怎麼了？像是新傷。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "她夾著你衝進了掩體，整合運動術師的法術在她背後三米的牆上炸開了花。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "偶爾也對她好點，沒必要什麼時候都互相針對成這個樣子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "......我知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "敲門聲"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島幹員",
      "text": "我可以進來嗎，龍門的陳長官？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "進來吧。她不介意。不好意思，讓你久等了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島幹員",
      "text": "沒有的事，不用見外。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島幹員",
      "text": "您好，陳長官。嗯......現在方便和羅德島這邊磋商一下任務內容嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島幹員",
      "text": "我們已經集結了數支小隊，他們正在甲板待命，準備好了隨時和你們一同出發。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "明白了，我馬上就去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島幹員",
      "text": "抱歉聽到了你和那位金髮警官之間的對話......我們知道近衛局損失慘重。你可以相信我們，羅德島能幫得上忙。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "......這不是我們現在該討論的話題。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "別介意，星熊。你也很清楚詩懷雅在做什麼，她是在穩定局勢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "她火氣上頭，你也是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "我只是順水推舟了一把。龍門損失慘重，這是“事實”，他們都應當知道的“事實”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "這不好，也不像是你會做的事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "這是為了龍門。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "這麼說話更不像你了，你是探長，是高級警司，不是政客，逢場作戲從來都不是你的天職。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "這確實不是一個正規的警員該做的事，但我別無選擇。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "你太累了，需要好好放個假。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "可能吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "呵......我確實想過。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "星熊，我需要一次很長很長的休假。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "等這次的事情結束以後就去吧，別死撐著。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "黃城，或者春都？要嘛就花郡吧，黃城離這裡太遠了，花在路上的時間夠再休一次了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "還是回維多利亞見見校友？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "我想去你的家鄉看看。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "別去，沒龍門有意思。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "哈哈。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "通訊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "......是機密頻道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "那我先出去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "麻煩你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "請說，我在聽。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "陳sir......那些感染者，整合運動......到處都是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "XR02？你在哪裡？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "木禾倉庫。我中了幾箭，應該活不長了。這是陷阱......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "等他們都走了你再來這裡。那個情報，我會留在身上。他們不會懂的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "代號XR02，你在那裡等著。近衛局會立刻趕過去。你手上的情報有時效性，我們必須拿到手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "我不確定，陳sir. 你有你的任務，我不想拖累你們。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "XR02，不准死。你必須活下去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "......我沒法說服你，陳sir. 你們要小心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "等等，有動靜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "【電流聲】",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "XR02？XR02！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "星熊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "啊，在。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "去整備隊伍吧，我們該走了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島幹員",
      "text": "陳長官，你要出發了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "羅德島還剩下多少武裝力量？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島幹員",
      "text": "這不在可交換情報裡，陳長官。我們接到的命令是輔助近衛局行動，但不能直接聽從你的調遣，長官。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "我好像還沒提出這種要求。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島幹員",
      "text": "抱、抱歉，多言了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "沒事。我只是想詢問下羅德島的狀況，問問你們有沒有安全保衛上的難題，是否需要近衛局的幫助。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島幹員",
      "text": "整合運動多次被擊退，已經放棄進攻羅德島本艦了。從種種跡象來看，龍門的形勢要比羅德島嚴峻得多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島幹員",
      "text": "抱歉，這樣形容好像不太對......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "也就是說，你們並不需要近衛局的幫助。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島幹員",
      "text": "是的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "那麼暫時地，近衛局確實需要你們一點小小的幫助。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島幹員",
      "text": "啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "整合運動封鎖了接泊區域的主幹道。我需要打開一個缺口。近衛局的時間不多，請各位爭分奪秒。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島幹員",
      "text": "這是協議內容，長官，我們義不容辭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "那就好。跟我來！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
